  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide financial incentives to encourage investment in renewable energy production in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Provide financial incentives to encourage investment in renewable energy production in Uganda  is a component of On and off Grid Small Scale Renewable Energy in Uganda reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xa3;8,900,000. It works in the following sector(s): Electric power transmission and distribution (centralised grids), Hydro-electric power plants, Biofuel-fired power plants, Solar energy for centralised grids, Energy policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
